    "basmil_image_text_BWQNih": {
      "type": "basmil-image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "content_DbBhXr": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<brown>Description</brown>",
            "subtitle": "",
            "description": "<p>A gift for those who prioritize fitness, endurance, and an active lifestyle, we bring you a powerful combo of nature's purest sources: Everest Shilajit + Shilajit Concoction in one bottle or Everest shilajit soft resin. The Shilajit resin, in its soft, concentrated form, dissolves quickly for effortless use, while the Everest Shilajit and Shilajit combination delivers pure intensity. Perfect for those who push their limits every day</p><ul><li><strong>Boosts Stamina:</strong> Supports endurance and overall physical performance.</li><li><strong>Enhances Mental Clarity:</strong> Sharpens focus while reducing stress and fatigue.</li><li><strong>Speeds Up Muscle Recovery:</strong> Helps in faster recovery after intense workouts.</li><li><strong>Supports Natural Detox:</strong> Helps the body flush out toxins.</li><li><strong>Boosts Testosterone Levels:</strong> 75% fulvic acid works to enhance Leydig cell function for natural testosterone production. </li><li><strong>Natural Energy Boost:</strong> Provides sustained energy for physical and mental activity.</li><li><strong>Mood Enhancer:</strong> Helps lift mood and reduce stress naturally with its psychoactive effects.</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": ""
          }
        }
      },
